WEBVTT

00:18:57.996 --> 00:19:00.996
the pushback they're getting on the output
of social media and so forth.

00:19:01.788 --> 00:19:06.538
How do you assemble that pool
of experts who stand

00:19:06.538 --> 00:19:08.871
for human values that we actually want?

00:19:12.204 --> 00:19:13.538
I mean, we talk about this all the time,

00:19:13.538 --> 00:19:15.163
I don't think this is like solely

00:19:15.371 --> 00:19:18.788
or even not even close to majorly
up to opening night to decide,

00:19:18.788 --> 00:19:23.121
I think we need to begin a societal
conversation now about how we're going to

00:19:23.121 --> 00:19:26.621
make those decisions, how we're going to
make sure we have representational input

00:19:26.621 --> 00:19:30.954
in that, and how we sort of make these
very difficult global governance systems.